        "item_gHi789": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Cookie Categories We Use",
            "text": "<h4>1. Necessary (Essential)</h4><p>Required for the basic functioning of the Site — cart, checkout, account login, security. Without them, the Site won't work correctly. These cookies do not require consent (they're set automatically, under the ePrivacy Directive) and cannot be disabled through the Site's settings.</p><h4>2. Functional</h4><p>Remember your preferences — language, country, currency — so you don't have to choose them again on every visit.</p><h4>3. Analytics</h4><p>We use Google Analytics to understand how visitors use the Site (which pages they visit, where they come from) — this helps us improve it. Set only with your consent.</p><h4>4. Marketing/Advertising</h4><p>We use Meta Pixel (Facebook/Instagram) to show you relevant ads and measure their effectiveness. These cookies may share information about your behaviour on the Site with Meta Platforms Ireland Limited. Set only with your consent.</p>",
            "heading_color": "secondary"
          }
        },
        "item_jKl012": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How We Obtain Your Consent",
            "text": "<p>On your first visit to the Site, you'll see a cookie settings banner where you can accept all categories, decline non-essential ones, or choose manually. You can change your choice at any time via the cookie settings on the Site (usually available in the footer).</p>",
            "heading_color": "secondary"
