        },
        "item_mNo345": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Third-Party Cookies",
            "text": "<p>Some cookies are set not by us directly, but by our partners (Google, Meta, Shopify) — their processing is governed by these companies' own policies:</p><ul><li><a href=\"https://policies.google.com/technologies/cookies\">Google Cookie Policy</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/privacy/policies/cookies/\">Meta Data Policy</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.shopify.com/legal/cookies\">Shopify Cookie Policy</a></li></ul>",
            "heading_color": "secondary"
          }
        },
        "item_pQr678": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How Long Cookies Are Stored",
            "text": "<p>Some cookies last only for your browsing session (deleted when you close your browser), while others persist longer (up to several months or years), depending on their purpose. The exact duration is set by each individual service (Google, Meta, Shopify) under its own rules.</p>",
